	(text "Stage 5 of 5: control bit 4 (weight 16).\nOutbound pole 1: COM=OIN_i, NC->OOUT_i, NO->OOUT_(i+16 mod 26).\nReturn pole 2:   COM=RIN_i, NC->ROUT_i, NO->ROUT_(i-16 mod 26).\nCTRL = 24 V stage drive, GND = 0 V. Coil pin 1 = +, pin 12 = - (verify polarity)."
